</h2>

<p class="intro-text">

Sometimes we know ourselves very well.

Sometimes we don't notice patterns in the
way we react, speak, think or handle difficult
situations.

Character Mirror gives you situations and
choices that allow you to explore those patterns.

</p>

<div class="notice">

⚠️ This experience does not permanently define
