<div class="head">

<div class="eye left"></div>
<div class="eye right"></div>

<div class="mouth"></div>

</div>

<div class="body"></div>

<div class="arm left"></div>
<div class="arm right"></div>

<div class="leg left"></div>
<div class="leg right"></div>

</div>

</div>

<div class="speech">

<div class="speaker">
LIFEKEY CHARACTER
</div>

<div class="dialogue">

“I'm going to place you in a few
